		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Moss-colored wyvern whose tail ends in the upper torso and head of a woman. Prefers to set ambushes, luring in unwary victims.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 38, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 rend +6 (2d6) or 1 fire breath or 1 charm, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charm</strong>. Near, one creature, CHA 15+ or beguiled for 1d4 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fire Breath</strong>. Fills a near-sized cube extending from vouivre, DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage. Cannot use again for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
